class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="send-parcels-of-all-sizes" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Send parcels of all sizes<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->At Evri, we offer delivery services for different-sized parcels to accommodate everyone’s needs.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDeJbqstJ9-cfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_37914ebc.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDeJbqstJ9-cfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3791.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C141%2C7650%2C5087&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDeJbqstJ9-cfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3791.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C141%2C7650%2C5087&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDeJbqstJ9-cfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3791.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C141%2C7650%2C5087&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier delivering a postable parcel into the mailbox of a block of flats" width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Postable parcels<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We class even smaller parcels, like large letters, as postable parcels. These are parcels that usually fit through the letterbox, so you won’t need to be in for it to be delivered!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Send postable parcels-open Send postable parcels page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/our-services/postable" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send postable parcels<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6oxnZbqstJ9-cV-_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10712ee51.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6oxnZbqstJ9-cV-_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10712.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8045%2C5350&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6oxnZbqstJ9-cV-_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10712.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8045%2C5350&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6oxnZbqstJ9-cV-_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10712.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8045%2C5350&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An older man is sat a table. He is measuring a parcel&#39;s length with a tape measure." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Small parcels<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->No delivery is too small for us to send. So, whether you’re sending clothes or posting a book, we can help.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Send a small parcel-open Send a small parcel page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/our-services/small-parcel" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send a small parcel<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x5ZbqstJ9-pVH_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4488bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x5ZbqstJ9-pVH_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4488.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x5ZbqstJ9-pVH_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4488.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x5ZbqstJ9-pVH_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4488.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier is smiling posing towards the camera with three parcels in their grasp." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Large parcel deliveries<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you want to send large parcels with us, such as children’s car seats, that’s no problem. You’ll just need to meet the requirements of our large parcels, then you can send them out to your lucky recipient. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Send large parcels-open Send large parcels page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/our-services/large-parcel" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send large parcels<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="