 Store or Google Play.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><div class="landing-feature-banner__app-store" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><a href="https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/hermes-parcels/id1446461114" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank" class="landing-feature-banner__app-store-button" aria-label="Download on the App Store" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Download on the App Store" width="140" height="42" class="landing-feature-banner__app-store-logo" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc><!--]--></a><a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.hermes.hercules" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank" class="landing-feature-banner__app-store-button" aria-label="Get it on Google Play" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/d119a56a-6383-4e8e-90ef-9a13f7255f7f_google-play-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/d119a56a-6383-4e8e-90ef-9a13f7255f7f_google-play-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/d119a56a-6383-4e8e-90ef-9a13f7255f7f_google-play-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/d119a56a-6383-4e8e-90e