:26,"spans":27},"paragraph","We offer flexible, cheap and speedy delivery services",[],{"link_type":29},"Any",{"link_type":29},{"dimensions":32,"alt":35,"copyright":21,"url":36,"id":37,"edit":38},{"width":33,"height":34},500,132,"Send a parcel","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fbe2c756c-941a-4d5c-9ee4-e588846e0298_send-landing.svg","YiExBxIAACgAAWmC",{"x":39,"y":39,"zoom":40,"background":41},0,1,"#fff",{},{"link_type":12},"page_header$491c8e12-61af-47e2-aa24-b30d1e31f0df","page_header",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":47,"primary":49,"id":99,"slice_type":100,"slice_label":21},[48],{},{"CardImage":50,"CardAvatar":60,"CardTitle":61,"CardText":62,"ButtonText":35,"ButtonUrl":95,"IsEco":98},{"dimensions":51,"alt":54,"copyright":21,"url":55,"id":56,"edit":57},{"width":52,"height":53},1000,665,"A woman is sat at home at her desk smiling looking at her laptop screen. She is also on the phone.","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdDpbqstJ9-ine_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7864.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C72%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zdDpbqstJ9-ine",{"x":39,"y":58,"zoom":40,"background":59},72,"transparent","none","What services do we offer?",[63,67,92],{"type":25,"text":64,"spans":65,"direction":66},"At Evri, we’re known for sending parcels directly to your door, but that’s not the only thing we do! ",[],"ltr",{"type":25,"text":68,"spans":69,"direction":66},"We offer a range of services to help you send parcels easily. There are 3 ways to send a parcel with Evri - simply drop off at a ParcelShop or Locker, or organise a Courier collection. You can also send parcels via our Standard service, or Next Day for even speedier delivery.",[70,78,80,85,86,91],{"start":71,"end":72,"type":73,"data":74},129,139,"hyperlink",{"link_type":75,"url":76,"target":77},"Web","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops","_blank",{"start":71,"end":72,"type":79},"strong",{"start":81,"end":82,"type":73,"data":83},143,149,{"link_type":75,"url":84,"target":77},"our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"start":81,"end":82,"type":79},{"start":87,"end":88,"type":73,"data":89},165,183,{"link_type":75,"url":90,"target":77},"our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"start":87,"end":88,"type":79},{"type":25,"text":93,"spans":94,"direction":66},"So, to help you understand how each can help with future deliveries, we’ve outlined each of the services we offer in more detail, below.",[],{"link_type":75,"key":96,"url":97},"54381324-8c1f-46f1-9374-21a3ca92bf70","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend",false,"card$90369337-7599-4c53-9e84-a9740ba0ca25","card",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":102,"primary":104,"id":125,"slice_type":126,"slice_label":21},[103],{},{"title":105,"bodyText":106,"isEco":98,"PaddingTop":98,"PaddingBottom":98,"NoMarginBottom":98,"hasButton":113,"buttonText":114,"buttonLink":115,"image":118},"Pricing",[107,110],{"type":25,"text":108,"spans":109,"direction":66},"At Evri, we like to keep prices as low as possible. You can send a parcel from £2.62, or use our Next Day delivery service, starting at just £3.20. ",[],{"type":25,"text":111,"spans":112,"direction":66},"The price of sending your parcel depends on the weight and delivery method you choose. But our prices are competitive. So, we’ll always offer cheap (and speedy) delivery services to suit you.",[],true,"Our prices",{"link_type":75,"key":116,"url":117},"3a09db50-53b0-4989-85f0-f86d761d9c10","\u002Four-services\u002Four-prices",{"dimensions":119,"alt":120,"copyright":21,"url":121,"id":122,"edit":123},{"width":52,"height":53},"An Evri Courier closing their boot after retrieving the correct parcel for a delivery","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDe5bqstJ9-cfR_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3848.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6pDe5bqstJ9-cfR",{"x":39,"y":124,"zoom":40,"background":59},8,"feature_banner$b7a27c81-c4f2-4aeb-a933-7a482f879afa","feature_banner",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":128,"primary":168,"id":178,"slice_type":179,"slice_label":21},[129,148],{"Title":130,"Description":135,"Image":139,"Label":21,"UrlText":35,"Url":145,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"SecondaryButtonText":21,"SecondaryButtonUrl":147,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":21,"ShowAppDownloadCta":21},[131],{"type":132,"text":133,"spans":134},"heading3","Standard delivery",[],[136],{"type":25,"text":137,"spans":138},"You can send your parcels using our Standard delivery service, which usually takes 2-4 days.",[],{"dimensions":140,"alt":141,"copyright":21,"url":142,"id":143,"edit":144},{"width":52,"height":53},"A handful of parcels are being handed to a recipient at the door. A blue Evri van can be seen in the background.","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y-UZbqstJ9-iKI_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9253.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6y-UZbqstJ9-iKI",{"x":39,"y":124,"zoom":40,"background":59},{"link_type":75,"key":146,"url":97},"e0e60918-09e0-4b0f-ae5c-3888f334640f",{"link_type":29},{"Title":149,"Description":153,"Image":157,"Label":21,"UrlText":163,"Url":164,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"SecondaryButtonText":21,"SecondaryButtonUrl":167,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":21,"ShowAppDownloadCta":21},[150],{"type":132,"text":151,"spans":152,"direction":66},"Next Day delivery",[],[154],{"type":25,"text":155,"spans":156},"You can send parcels quicker by choosing our Next Day delivery service. All you need to do is drop your parcel off at a Locker or ParcelShop before 12 noon. ",[],{"dimensions":158,"alt":159,"copyright":21,"url":160,"id":161,"edit":162},{"width":52,"height":53},"An Evri courier is entering the rear of a house through a side gate. He is carrying two parcels to drop off.","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdFpbqstJ9-ini_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8021.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zdFpbqstJ9-ini",{"x":39,"y":124,"zoom":40,"background":59},"Send Next Day",{"link_type":75,"key":165,"url":166},"86749bd5-ec81-4a41-99ff-13d6045146e7","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fnext-day-parcel-delivery",{"link_type":29},{"SectionTitle":169,"SectionDescription":174,"theme":21},[170],{"type":171,"text":172,"spans":173},"heading2","Our delivery services",[],[175],{"type":25,"text":176,"spans":177},"When sending a parcel with Evri, there are different delivery options available, such as Standard and Next Day delivery.",[],"article_link_module$319cadf1-b219-41bd-b50d-282f9a02b60d","article_link_module",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":181,"primary":183,"id":214,"slice_type":100,"slice_label":21},[182],{},{"CardImage":184,"CardAvatar":60,"CardTitle":190,"CardText":191,"ButtonText":210,"ButtonUrl":211,"IsEco":98},{"dimensions":185,"alt":186,"copyright":21,"url":187,"id":188,"edit":189},{"width":52,"height":53},"An Evri Courier is stood at a doorway holding two parcels. They are engaging in joyful conversation with a customer and a child with a football during the delivery.","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tiFpbqstJ9-e-g_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6820.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C7707%2C5125&w=1000&h=665","Z6tiFpbqstJ9-e-g",{"x":39,"y":124,"zoom":40,"background":59},"Weekend deliveries",[192,207],{"type":25,"text":193,"spans":194},"Convenience is key, and we know that arranging deliveries and collections on a Saturday or Sunday works with your schedule, so we’ve made it as easy as possible.",[195,198,201,204],{"start":196,"end":197,"type":79},79,87,{"start":196,"end":197,"type":73,"data":199},{"link_type":75,"url":200},"our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fsaturday-delivery",{"start":202,"end":203,"type":79},91,97,{"start":202,"end":203,"type":73,"data":205},{"link_type":75,"url":206},"our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fsunday-delivery",{"type":25,"text":208,"spans":209},"Couriers work over the weekend to get your parcels where they need to go! Offering courier collection, ParcelShop and Locker services mean your parcels can be sent any day of the week, including weekends. ",[],"Weekend delivery",{"link_type":75,"key":212,"url":213},"98b5f25b-bcdc-498d-8c7e-f6885798dff1","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fweekend-delivery","card$f2ad1c0d-e07a-43de-8495-4d1d1d975bb0",{"variation":216,"version":17,"items":217,"primary":274,"id":283,"slice_type":179,"slice_label":21},"3Column",[218,236,255],{"Title":219,"Description":223,"Image":227,"Label":21,"UrlText":221,"Url":233,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"SecondaryButtonText":21,"SecondaryButtonUrl":235,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":21,"ShowAppDownloadCta":21},[220],{"type":132,"text":221,"spans":222},"ParcelShops",[],[224],{"type":25,"text":225,"spans":226},"You can choose a ParcelShop online using our ParcelShop finder. All you need to do is package your items and take them there!",[],{"dimensions":228,"alt":229,"copyright":21,"url":230,"id":231,"edit":232},{"width":52,"height":53},"Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background.","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4",{"x":39,"y":124,"zoom":40,"background":59},{"link_type":75,"key":234,"url":76},"fce61862-bdc3-49a9-a316-a11571a94d7b",{"link_type":29},{"Title":237,"Description":241,"Image":245,"Label":21,"UrlText":239,"Url":252,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"SecondaryButtonText":21,"SecondaryButtonUrl":254,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":21,"ShowAppDownloadCta":21},[238],{"type":132,"text":239,"spans":240},"Lockers",[],[242],{"type":25,"text":243,"spans":244},"We also have Lockers to take your parcels to – or collect your parcels from. Just scan your parcel label using the barcode scanner and place your item inside to be collected. Simple!",[],{"dimensions":246,"alt":247,"copyright":21,"url":248,"id":249,"edit":250},{"width":52,"height":53},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":39,"y":251,"zoom":40,"background":59},17,{"link_type":75,"key":253,"url":84},"12c73173-ab29-4be0-94de-221fe9eacaf5",{"link_type":29},{"Title":256,"Description":260,"Image":264,"Label":21,"UrlText":270,"Url":271,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"SecondaryButtonText":21,"SecondaryButtonUrl":273,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":21,"ShowAppDownloadCta":21},[257],{"type":132,"text":258,"spans":259},"Courier collection",[],[261],{"type":25,"text":262,"spans":263,"direction":66},"With our Courier collection service, you can book your parcel collection and leave the rest with us. A Courier will come and collect your parcel, and you can choose a collection day up to 7 days in advance.",[],{"dimensions":265,"alt":266,"copyright":21,"url":267,"id":268,"edit":269},{"width":52,"height":53},"A customer has just handed their parcel to an Evri courier as a part of a doorstep collection. The customer is being handed a blue slip as a receipt of the transaction.","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xsZbqstJ9-pVA_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1545.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8158%2C5425&w=1000&h=665","Z69xsZbqstJ9-pVA",{"x":39,"y":124,"zoom":40,"background":59},"Courier services",{"link_type":75,"key":272,"url":90},"26eb65ec-5ab4-4994-b4cb-e7bd02ce0d3c",{"link_type":29},{"SectionTitle":275,"SectionDescription":279,"theme":21},[276],{"type":171,"text":277,"spans":278,"direction":66},"ParcelShops, Lockers and Courier collections",[],[280],{"type":25,"text":281,"spans":282},"Our different services help you send parcels easily. You can arrange for a courier to collect your parcel, or drop your package off at one of our ParcelShops or Lockers. But how do these services work?",[],"article_link_module$cc6895e9-97d4-4101-aa32-76d3ba301abc",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":285,"primary":287,"id":306,"slice_type":126,"slice_label":21},[286],{},{"title":288,"bodyText":289,"isEco":98,"PaddingTop":98,"PaddingBottom":113,"NoMarginBottom":98,"hasButton":113,"buttonText":288,"buttonLink":296,"image":299},"Send international parcels",[290,293],{"type":25,"text":291,"spans":292},"We can deliver your international packages to over 200+ countries and territories worldwide, for low prices - starting from as little as £6.08. Plus, we integrate with major marketplaces, so you can send bulk orders, hassle-free. ",[],{"type":25,"text":294,"spans":295},"These handy services make sending parcels to friends (or customers) overseas a doddle.",[],{"link_type":75,"key":297,"url":298},"2d0a938d-4ce3-415b-a49a-00b2c2d6b864","our-services\u002Finternational-courier-services",{"dimensions":300,"alt":302,"copyright":21,"url":303,"id":304,"edit":305},{"width":52,"height":301},667,"A customer sat on a sofa, holding their tablet and looking at their screen. The display shows the customer is reading about our three easy ways to return a parcel","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7xwwZ7c43Q3gITF_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5657-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z7xwwZ7c43Q3gITF",{"x":39,"y":39,"zoom":40,"background":59},"feature_banner$dcd1f26c-b8d7-4d8e-98d4-21de82db7eee",{"variation":308,"version":17,"items":309,"primary":311,"id":326,"slice_type":100,"slice_label":21},"cardNoImageWithCta",[310],{},{"CardAvatar":60,"CardTitle":312,"CardText":313,"ButtonText":323,"ButtonUrl":324,"IsEco":98},"Bulk Integrations",[314],{"type":25,"text":315,"spans":316,"direction":66},"Our bulk integrations service lets you send multiple parcels at once. Parcels uploaded through our bulk integrations tool can be sent using our Standard delivery service or Next Day delivery, and it’s easy to send using a ParcelShop, Locker or Courier collection.",[317,322],{"start":318,"end":319,"type":73,"data":320},4,21,{"link_type":75,"url":321,"target":77},"our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fbulk-send",{"start":318,"end":319,"type":79},"Bulk integrations",{"link_type":75,"key":325,"url":321},"653e5ce4-9163-41c8-9650-1938b6d4eca9","card$99b55547-c959-49a8-909c-661342a15204",{"variation":216,"version":17,"items":328,"primary":390,"id":399,"slice_type":179,"slice_label":21},[329,350,370],{"Title":330,"Description":334,"Image":338,"Label":21,"UrlText":345,"Url":346,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"SecondaryButtonText":21,"SecondaryButtonUrl":349,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":21,"ShowAppDownloadCta":21},[331],{"type":132,"text":332,"spans":333},"Postable parcels",[],[335],{"type":25,"text":336,"spans":337},"We class even smaller parcels, like large letters, as postable parcels. These are parcels that usually fit through the letterbox, so you won’t need to be in for it to be delivered!",[],{"dimensions":339,"alt":340,"copyright":21,"url":341,"id":342,"edit":343},{"width":52,"height":53},"An Evri Courier delivering a postable parcel into the mailbox of a block of flats","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDeJbqstJ9-cfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3791.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C141%2C7650%2C5087&w=1000&h=665","Z6pDeJbqstJ9-cfQ",{"x":39,"y":344,"zoom":40,"background":59},141,"Send postable parcels",{"link_type":75,"key":347,"url":348},"8cce672f-5f91-4f01-94ea-106262039120","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fpostable",{"link_type":29},{"Title":351,"Description":355,"Image":359,"Label":21,"UrlText":365,"Url":366,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"SecondaryButtonText":21,"SecondaryButtonUrl":369,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":21,"ShowAppDownloadCta":21},[352],{"type":132,"text":353,"spans":354},"Small parcels",[],[356],{"type":25,"text":357,"spans":358},"No delivery is too small for us to send. So, whether you’re sending clothes or posting a book, we can help.",[],{"dimensions":360,"alt":361,"copyright":21,"url":362,"id":363,"edit":364},{"width":52,"height":53},"An older man is sat a table. He is measuring a parcel's length with a tape measure.","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oxnZbqstJ9-cV-_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10712.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8045%2C5350&w=1000&h=665","Z6oxnZbqstJ9-cV-",{"x":39,"y":124,"zoom":40,"background":59},"Send a small parcel",{"link_type":75,"key":367,"url":368},"03b1cffb-012e-43db-aaf2-93be361c5e73","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fsmall-parcel",{"link_type":29},{"Title":371,"Description":375,"Image":379,"Label":21,"UrlText":385,"Url":386,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"SecondaryButtonText":21,"SecondaryButtonUrl":389,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":21,"ShowAppDownloadCta":21},[372],{"type":132,"text":373,"spans":374},"Large parcel deliveries",[],[376],{"type":25,"text":377,"spans":378},"If you want to send large parcels with us, such as children’s car seats, that’s no problem. You’ll just need to meet the requirements of our large parcels, then you can send them out to your lucky recipient. ",[],{"dimensions":380,"alt":381,"copyright":21,"url":382,"id":383,"edit":384},{"width":52,"height":53},"An Evri Courier is smiling posing towards the camera with three parcels in their grasp.","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x5ZbqstJ9-pVH_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4488.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z69x5ZbqstJ9-pVH",{"x":39,"y":124,"zoom":40,"background":59},"Send large parcels",{"link_type":75,"key":387,"url":388},"bb5eeef9-3d50-4698-9c10-ae652bfa13e1","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Flarge-parcel",{"link_type":29},{"SectionTitle":391,"SectionDescription":395,"theme":21},[392],{"type":171,"text":393,"spans":394},"Send parcels of all sizes",[],[396],{"type":25,"text":397,"spans":398},"At Evri, we offer delivery services for different-sized parcels to accommodate everyone’s needs.",[],"article_link_module$a145f5da-492c-461b-93a8-faf2a8a40047",{"variation":401,"version":17,"items":402,"primary":427,"id":442,"slice_type":443,"slice_label":21},"darkBannerLeftImageAppStore",[403,416],{"appDownloadLogoImage":404,"appDownloadLogoAriaLabel":412,"appDownloadLogoLink":413},{"dimensions":405,"alt":408,"copyright":21,"url":409,"id":410,"edit":411},{"width":406,"height":407},140,42,"Download on the App Store","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg","YinytBIAAC4AjoLX",{"x":39,"y":39,"zoom":40,"background":41},"Download on the Apple App store",{"link_type":75,"key":414,"url":415},"88a2377a-6bfe-4320-ae77-08efe527bbc7","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fapps.apple.com\u002Fgb\u002Fapp\u002Fhermes-parcels\u002Fid1446461114",{"appDownloadLogoImage":417,"appDownloadLogoAriaLabel":423,"appDownloadLogoLink":424},{"dimensions":418,"alt":419,"copyright":21,"url":420,"id":421,"edit":422},{"width":406,"height":407},"Get it on Google Play","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd119a56a-6383-4e8e-90ef-9a13f7255f7f_google-play-white.svg","YinytBIAAC8AjoLZ",{"x":39,"y":39,"zoom":40,"background":41},"Download on the Google Play Store",{"link_type":75,"key":425,"url":426},"e8261980-9850-46ec-8095-e38e86fd00c0","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fplay.google.com\u002Fstore\u002Fapps\u002Fdetails?id=com.hermes.hercules",{"theme":21,"show_premium_logo":21,"label":21,"label_theme":21,"titleH2":428,"bodyText":429,"image":436,"showAppDownloadLogo":113},"The Evri mobile app",[430,433],{"type":25,"text":431,"spans":432},"The Evri mobile app makes sending, tracking and returning your parcel even easier to manage. You can also divert your parcel, view safe place photos, update your delivery preferences and find a nearby ParcelShop or Locker.",[],{"type":25,"text":434,"spans":435},"Just download our app from the Apple App Store or Google Play.",[],{"dimensions":437,"alt":438,"copyright":21,"url":439,"id":440,"edit":441},{"width":52,"height":53},"A mobile phone is held outright at a desk with parcels in the background. The screen displays Evri's website with the customer about to book their deliveries.","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R6VZbqstJ9-SUT_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8717.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R6VZbqstJ9-SUT",{"x":39,"y":124,"zoom":40,"background":59},"landing_feature_banner$1a8ac4b8-69af-493b-a9f4-a5e4a7813fa7","landing_feature_banner",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":445,"primary":447,"id":471,"slice_type":100,"slice_label":21},[446],{},{"CardImage":448,"CardAvatar":60,"CardTitle":454,"CardText":455,"ButtonText":468,"ButtonUrl":469,"IsEco":98},{"dimensions":449,"alt":450,"copyright":21,"url":451,"id":452,"edit":453},{"width":52,"height":53},"Top down view of a man with a parcel on his lap watching an Evri video. The video is of a mother and two children smiling and waving.","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tfKJbqstJ9-e3I_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7484.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6tfKJbqstJ9-e3I",{"x":39,"y":124,"zoom":40,"background":59},"Evri Video services",[456,465],{"type":25,"text":457,"spans":458},"Did you know that when sending a parcel as a present for a birthday, or special event, or from your business, you can add a video message by using our Evri Video service?",[459,462],{"start":460,"end":461,"type":79},151,169,{"start":460,"end":461,"type":73,"data":463},{"link_type":75,"url":464},"our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fevri-video",{"type":25,"text":466,"spans":467},"Evri Video adds personalisation to your delivery, making it extra special for your chosen recipient. What’s better, this video service is easy and speedy to use, and you can use it as many times as you like!",[],"Evri video",{"link_type":75,"key":470,"url":464},"e3d44280-daab-4628-9a0b-caba0b35a7ed","card$db9bd4da-fba4-4676-b7df-c62f685783c7",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":473,"primary":475,"id":516,"slice_type":100,"slice_label":21},[474],{},{"CardImage":476,"CardAvatar":60,"CardTitle":482,"CardText":483,"ButtonText":21,"ButtonUrl":515,"IsEco":98},{"dimensions":477,"alt":478,"copyright":21,"url":479,"id":480,"edit":481},{"width":52,"height":53},"A customer sat on a sofa in their lounge, holding their mobile phone and looking at their screen with a mug in their other hand.","our-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xs4pbqstJ9-WfE_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5416.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6Xs4pbqstJ9-WfE",{"x":39,"y":124,"zoom":40,"background":59},"Alexa and Google Assistant",[484,493,496,500,503,506,509,512],{"type":25,"text":485,"spans":486,"direction":66},"As technology has evolved, so have our services. We know how busy life can get, so we’ve incorporated our services into Alexa and Google Assistant to help you manage your parcels efficiently.  ",[487,492],{"start":488,"end":489,"type":73,"data":490},120,125,{"link_type":75,"url":491,"target":77},"our-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Falexa",{"start":488,"end":489,"type":79},{"type":25,"text":494,"spans":495,"direction":66},"These voice-assisted services help you manage your deliveries, just ask them to:",[],{"type":497,"text":498,"spans":499,"direction":66},"list-item","Create a return to a retailer you’ve bought something from",[],{"type":497,"text":501,"spans":502,"direction":66},"Create a returns label",[],{"type":497,"text":504,"spans":505,"direction":66},"Find out where your parcel is",[],{"type":497,"text":507,"spans":508,"direction":66},"Ask when your parcel will arrive",[],{"type":497,"text":510,"spans":511,"direction":66},"Divert your parcel",[],{"type":25,"text":513,"spans":514,"direction":66},"So, however you want to send or receive your parcel, we’ve got you covered.",[],{"link_type":29},"card$9c42a196-4ef2-49cc-8b1c-239624040fd0",[15,46,101,127,180,215,284,307,327,400,444,472],["Reactive",519],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":520,"$sclients":586,"$sglobal-basket-count":21},{"abtasty":521,"accessibe":524,"appPromoBanner":527,"autoDivertUpdates":530,"awin":533,"bulkInternational":536,"bulkSendEnabled":539,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":542,"enableBasketCount":545,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":548,"euCustomsDuty":551,"groovyAdvert":554,"newInternationalSendFlow":557,"newinternationalpages":564,"oohPreferenceFlag":568,"opentel":571,"premium":574,"savedCards":577,"smallParcelSize":580,"yourPricesDrawer":583},{"_createdAt":522,"_updatedAt":523,"enabled":113},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":525,"_updatedAt":526,"enabled":113},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":528,"_updatedAt":529,"enabled":98},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":531,"_updatedAt":532,"enabled":98},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":534,"_updatedAt":535,"enabled":98},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":537,"_updatedAt":538,"enabled":113},"2025-06-23T14:37:21.102Z","2026-01-28T10:04:13.631Z",{"_createdAt":540,"_updatedAt":541,"enabled":113},"2024-11-14T16:08:24.373Z","2025-06-05T12:32:29.563Z",{"_createdAt":543,"_updatedAt":544,"enabled":113},"2024-11-14T16:09:05.362Z","2024-11-21T10:37:32.927Z",{"_createdAt":546,"_updatedAt":547,"enabled":113},"2025-10-28T13:17:38.716Z","2026-04-14T10:49:05.879Z",{"_createdAt":549,"_updatedAt":550,"enabled":113},"2025-11-07T14:21:27.204Z","2026-05-14T12:54:05.701Z",{"_createdAt":552,"_updatedAt":5